{"4032250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tiempo", "steam_appid": 4032250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>**A student team project designed to deliver a ~10 minute experience.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tiempo</strong> is a 3D platformer where every step brings you closer to stopping your rival’s plan to freeze time forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032250/extras/3b55e74a69915c5f8b10da3cf6fc005c.poster.avif?t=1762213687\" width=900 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032250/extras/3b55e74a69915c5f8b10da3cf6fc005c.webm?t=1762213687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032250/extras/3b55e74a69915c5f8b10da3cf6fc005c.mp4?t=1762213687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your unique time powers; pause to halt traps mid-motion, rewind to undo mistakes, and manipulate mechanisms like moving platforms to solve puzzles and outmaneuver enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032250/extras/09e2648ff456bf5ddc723079048845bc.poster.avif?t=1762213687\" width=900 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032250/extras/09e2648ff456bf5ddc723079048845bc.webm?t=1762213687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032250/extras/09e2648ff456bf5ddc723079048845bc.mp4?t=1762213687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every floor of the tower, new challenges emerge: shifting hazards, cunning foes, and clever contraptions designed to block your ascent. Only by mastering your control over time can you reach the top and restore the flow of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032250/extras/e9c56d87e35c234be710fcaa167805b0.poster.avif?t=1762213687\" width=900 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032250/extras/e9c56d87e35c234be710fcaa167805b0.webm?t=1762213687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032250/extras/e9c56d87e35c234be710fcaa167805b0.mp4?t=1762213687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>**A student team project designed to deliver a ~10 minute experience.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tiempo</strong> is a 3D platformer where every step brings you closer to stopping your rival’s plan to freeze time forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032250/extras/3b55e74a69915c5f8b10da3cf6fc005c.poster.avif?t=1762213687\" width=900 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032250/extras/3b55e74a69915c5f8b10da3cf6fc005c.webm?t=1762213687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032250/extras/3b55e74a69915c5f8b10da3cf6fc005c.mp4?t=1762213687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your unique time powers; pause to halt traps mid-motion, rewind to undo mistakes, and manipulate mechanisms like moving platforms to solve puzzles and outmaneuver enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032250/extras/09e2648ff456bf5ddc723079048845bc.poster.avif?t=1762213687\" width=900 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032250/extras/09e2648ff456bf5ddc723079048845bc.webm?t=1762213687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032250/extras/09e2648ff456bf5ddc723079048845bc.mp4?t=1762213687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every floor of the tower, new challenges emerge: shifting hazards, cunning foes, and clever contraptions designed to block your ascent. Only by mastering your control over time can you reach the top and restore the flow of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032250/extras/e9c56d87e35c234be710fcaa167805b0.poster.avif?t=1762213687\" width=900 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032250/extras/e9c56d87e35c234be710fcaa167805b0.webm?t=1762213687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032250/extras/e9c56d87e35c234be710fcaa167805b0.mp4?t=1762213687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Climb a towering clockwork spire in this 3D platformer. Use time-pausing and rewinding powers to overcome traps, puzzles, and enemies as you race to stop your rival from freezing time forever.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032250/3ef8a56f38accdcc349162567ac2af5830f7d169/header.jpg?t=1762213687", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032250/d7ccbc00cb61b1d6353adefe4d672a8a06defc46/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762213687", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032250/d7ccbc00cb61b1d6353adefe4d672a8a06defc46/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762213687", "website": "https://vfs.edu/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i5 3.0GHz or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i7 3.4GHz or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> VIDIA Quadro RTX 5000 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["Vancouver Film School"], "publishers": ["Vancouver Film School"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}